{
  "title": "Hot Smoked Chinese Tofu Stew",
  "description": "A funky, shattering Chinese stew that blends smoky paprika with silky tofu and crisp vegetables, simmered to perfection in a traditional kazan cauldron. The dish is satvik-friendly and packs a pop of heat.",
