      "amount": "2 tbsp",
      "notes": "chopped"
    },
    {
      "name": "Salt",
      "amount": "to taste"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat the sesame oil in a kazan cauldron over medium heat.",
    "Add diced onion, minced garlic, and grated ginger, cooking until the onion is translucent.",
    "Stir in sliced carrots, bell pepper, and stir until the vegetables soften for 4 minutes.",
    "Pour in the vegetable stock and bring the mixture to a gentle boil.",
    "Add the cubed tofu, smoked paprika, soy sauce, and salt, then reduce the heat and let simmer for 15 minutes.",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning if needed, then stir in fresh cilantro.",
    "Serve the stew hot straight from the kazan cauldron into bowls, garnishing with extra cilantro if desired."
  ],
